# CRM Notification Governance

Before creating a CRM page or changing notification, realtime, polling or cache
recovery behavior, read `.agents/skills/pusher-management/SKILL.md` and the relevant
sections of its `references/pusher-management.md` guidebook.
Apply its mandatory rules together with `AGENTS.md` and relevant domain skills.
Complete the new-page contract and maintain the page/channel/event policy tables.
Distinguish current implementation from target requirements and unfinished phases.
Do not create a client per component, publish private CRM data on public channels,
or use blanket cache revalidation as recovery.
Report actual checks and remaining gaps; documentation alone is not CI enforcement.
